Hallows Eve Macro Studio 3.3.3 — equip confirmation validation
Validation date: 2026-10-23 (America/Toronto)
Environment: Linux; Windows foreground and keyboard input mocked.
Actual OpenCV hotbar screenshots, Tesseract OCR and detector threads used where applicable.
No live Roblox or Windows input acceptance/timing guarantee.

PASS: all packaged Python files parse successfully.
PASS: tests/test_equip_confirmation.py (13 scenarios)
  Dropped first inputs on two of three windows recover independently.
  Successfully equipped third window receives no extra toggle.
  Delayed input is confirmed before any repeat toggle.
  Covered-banner retry yields after input; confirmation resumes next visit.
  Manual fallback confirms the exact configured slot despite stale command flags.
  A hidden hotbar stays unconfirmed through 30 seconds; no blind repeat toggle.
  Conflicting readings do not confirm or authorize a toggle.
  Final fresh read catches a late selection before another key.
  Wrong selected slot is corrected; slot 10 maps to key 0.
  Smart mode skips Dracula slots and avoids mutation OCR during equip recovery.
  All-Dracula windows are left unequipped without endless retries.
  Event end, early cleanup and a latched prior end block late equips.
  Event end preempts confirmation without losing the cleanup hint.
  Real selected/unselected fixtures classify correctly; blank frames remain unknown.
PASS: tests/test_event_equip.py
  Actual scheduler recovers skipped windows, isolates disconnects,
  preserves cleanup priority, and requires verification of sent manual commands.
PASS: tests/test_focus.py
  Mouse-free activation, bounded foreground verification, no window movement,
  idle focus rate limits and wrong-window input protection.
PASS: tests/test_confirmed_cleanup.py
  Dropped/delayed put-away input, hidden animations, unavailable focus,
  popup recovery, actual hotbar/countdown screenshots, countdown and occlusion guards.
PASS: tests/test_event_priority.py
  Stale OCR discarded, event-end interruption, command tracked during key hold,
  back-to-back event ordering and suspension of routine event-time chores.
PASS: tests/test_window_recovery.py
  Disconnections isolated; monitor replacement; daily popup visual checks and rate limits.
PASS: tests/test_performance.py
  Bounded diagnostic publication; cached static templates; fresh event verdicts.

All seven regression scripts completed with exit code 0 after updating the AST
harness in test_event_priority.py to load the new equip helper functions.
To reproduce, use Python with OpenCV, NumPy, pytesseract and Tesseract installed:
  python tests/test_equip_confirmation.py
  python tests/test_event_equip.py
  python tests/test_focus.py
  python tests/test_confirmed_cleanup.py
  python tests/test_event_priority.py
  python tests/test_window_recovery.py
  python tests/test_performance.py
